Subject: media/i2c: SM7250 camera: camss, CCI, hi846 (untested)

Combined diff of the following commits (base v7.3-rc7):

  - media: venus: Make the interconnect paths optional
  - media: venus: Add SM7250 support
  - media: venus: Unmask WD and CPU interrupts on Iris1
  - media: venus: sm7250: Add max_load and Iris1 clock config preset
  - i2c: qcom-cci: Add SM7250 compatible
  - media: qcom: camss: Add SM7250 support

